# Copy to .env.local for development. Set the same values in your host's
# environment settings for production. Never commit real keys.
#
# The public site address is NOT configured here: it is fixed in
# src/lib/site.ts (https://www.ingensoloutions.com) so previews and stale
# settings can never become the canonical origin. Any NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL
# left in the host's settings is ignored and can be deleted.

# Enquiry form delivery via Resend (https://resend.com)
# 1. In Resend, verify the ingensoloutions.com domain (add the DNS records it
#    shows wherever the domain is managed).
#    (Not ingensolutions.com: that domain belongs to another company.)
# 2. Create an API key with "Sending access". This is the only required value.
RESEND_API_KEY=
# Optional. Inbox that receives enquiries (comma-separate several).
# Default in code: mohammed@ingensoloutions.com
ENQUIRY_TO=
# Optional. Sender shown in the From field; must be on a domain verified in
# Resend. Default in code: "Ingen website <website@ingensoloutions.com>".
# The older nashr.net name RESEND_FROM is also accepted. (LEAD_TO_EMAIL is no
# longer read, so a leftover value can't route enquiries to an old inbox.)
ENQUIRY_FROM=
